_:r1b2 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "The artistic act is the designation, by Sun & Rain Works, of its auction engagement as a work — not the auction's ordinary business, which was carried out by Sotheby's. The designation is an assertion by the artist." .
