_:r8b1 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "Evidence archive: Sun & Rain Works auction engagement (2009)" .
_:r8b1 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670> .
_:r8b1 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P72_has_language> <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300388277> .
_:r8b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation> .
_:r8b2 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "record:evidence-live-auction-2009" .
_:r8b2 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300312355> .
_:r8b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E42_Identifier> .
_:r8b3 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "Evidence status: mixed. Independently verifiable: (1) the public Sotheby's catalogue lot (sale N08533, lot 16) at https://www.sothebys.com/en/auctions/ecatalogue/2009/photographs-n08533/lot.16.html ; (2) a Sun and Rain Works public post carrying the 'WTF is Art' theme (X post 373257603108704256). Its date is confirmed independently by the platform's timestamp-encoded ID, which decodes to 2013-08-30T01:35:22Z — that is 2013-08-29 at 15:35 in Hawaii-Aleutian Standard Time, the studio's local time, and the post is dated 2013-08-29 on that basis. An auditor decoding the identifier should expect the UTC date to fall on the following day. Held privately by the studio: the 2008-2009 correspondence, receipts, and photographs. Selected private items can be promoted to public evidence as redaction and rights review are completed." .
_:r8b3 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416> .
_:r8b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> .
_:r8b4 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "The consignment engagement is corroborated by inbound 2008 correspondence from Sotheby's Photographs (confirming intake logistics and naming the department administrator) and by a shared Hana, HI mailing address linking the consignor to the Sun & Rain Works domain receipts. Contemporaneous conceptual intent is evidenced by art-referential documentation (an Andy Warhol volume juxtaposed with the photograph in images sent to Sotheby's). Each item is scoped to what it shows: these evidence identity, consignment, intent, and the concept's public continuity — not a witnessed live-creation event, and not precedence over any later artist or event." .
_:r8b4 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type> <http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416> .
_:r8b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object> .
_:r8b5 <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P190_has_symbolic_content> "Part of the documentation described here has since been dated and published as a record in its own right. The art-referential documentation photographs — including the frame composing the print with a volume of Warhol's philosophy — carry camera-written Exif placing them on 2008-08-08, and their close-up of the print's verso agrees in four particulars with the public Sotheby's catalogue entry for lot 16. That material is no longer only studio-reported: see the documentation-photograph evidence record." .
